      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: Sometimes as short as an hour, but I dont have exact figures. The rule of thumb for me is immediately after I open a project, I need to decide right then if I want to keep the CC open or not as it will usually be stuck by the time I next come back to it. Not stuck completely. You can still use it, its just frozen on the screen. Cant downsize and cant close, but everything else still works.",
